---
import '../styles/global.css';

interface Props {
  title: string;
  description: string;
  pageType?: 'home' | 'article';
}

const { title, description, pageType = 'article' } = Astro.props;
const root = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/`;
const href = (part: string) => `${root}${part.replace(/^\//, '')}`;
const canonical = new URL(Astro.url.pathname, Astro.site).toString();
const siteTitle = title.includes('HUNTtheTRUTH') ? title : `${title} | HUNTtheTRUTH`;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-GB">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#080e19" />
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:title" content={siteTitle} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:type" content={pageType === 'home' ? 'website' : 'article'} />
    <meta property="og:url" content={canonical} />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
    <link rel="canonical" href={canonical} />
    <link rel="sitemap" href={href('sitemap-index.xml')} />
    <title>{siteTitle}</title>
  </head>
  <body class={pageType}>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to main content</a>
    <header class="topbar">
      <div class="topbar-inner">
        <a class="wordmark" href={href('')} aria-label="HUNTtheTRUTH homepage">
          <span class="wordmark-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✧</span> HUNT<span>THE</span>TRUTH
        </a>
        <nav aria-label="Primary navigation" class="topnav">
          <a href={href('seraphine-lore-misinformation-investigation/')}><strong>Full investigation</strong></a>
          <a href={href('seraphine-controversy/')}>Why is Seraphine controversial?</a>
          <a href={href('seraphine-original-lore/')}>Original lore</a>
          <a href={href('seraphine-skarner/')}>Seraphine &amp; Skarner</a>
          <a href={href('sources/')}>Sources</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>
    <main id="main"><slot /></main>
    <footer class="footer">
      <div class="footer-topline"></div>
      <div class="container footer-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">SERAPHINE · OCTOBER 2020–2026</span>
          <h2>Official Riot lore omitted. Influencer cherry-picking. Six years of misinformation.</h2>
          <p>Riot published <em>Champion Insights: Seraphine</em> on the <strong>official League of Legends website</strong> on 12 October 2020. Influential YouTube criticism omitted its crucial empathy and Brackern explanations — sometimes while using other parts of that very article. HUNTtheTRUTH documents influencer cross-references, bandwagon effects, source laundering and Google AI citations, alongside <strong>Wikipedia.org’s six-year omission of Riot’s official developer source</strong>.</p>
        </div>
        <nav class="footer-links" aria-label="Research articles">
          <strong>Investigation and misinformation</strong>
          <a href={href('seraphine-lore-misinformation-investigation/')}><strong>Full misinformation investigation</strong></a>
          <a href={href('seraphine-misinformation/')}>How Seraphine lore misinformation spread</a>
          <a href={href('seraphine-controversy/')}>Why is Seraphine controversial?</a>
          <strong>Original lore and evidence</strong>
          <a href={href('seraphine-original-lore/')}>Original 2020 lore</a>
          <a href={href('seraphine-lore-changes/')}>October 2020 revisions</a>
          <a href={href('seraphine-brackern/')}>The Brackern and Hextech</a>
          <a href={href('sources/')}>Source register</a>
          <strong>Seraphine and Skarner</strong>
          <a href={href('seraphine-skarner/')}>Seraphine and Skarner</a>
          <a href={href('seraphine-helped-brackern-skarner/')}>Seraphine did help the Brackern and Skarner</a>
          <a href={href('seraphine-skarner-brackern-retcon/')}>#JusticeForSkarner: the hate train and Riot’s retcon</a>
          <a href={href('skarnerphine/')}>Skarnerphine</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
      <div class="container legal-footnote">Independent fan research; not affiliated with or endorsed by Riot Games. League of Legends, Runeterra and Seraphine are Riot Games properties. Original site design; no Riot logos or artwork are included.</div>
    </footer>
    <script>
      for (const anchor of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLAnchorElement>('a[href]')) {
        const target = new URL(anchor.href, document.baseURI);
        if ((target.protocol === 'https:' || target.protocol === 'http:') && target.origin !== window.location.origin) {
          anchor.target = '_blank';
          anchor.rel = 'noopener noreferrer';
        }
      }
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
